id #BFBFBF 1.0pt; mso-border-right-themecolor: background1; mso-border-right-themeshade: 191; mso-border-top-alt: solid #BFBFBF .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: background1; mso-border-top-themeshade: 191; mso-border-left-alt: solid #BFBFBF .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: background1; mso-border-left-themeshade: 191; mso-border-alt: solid #BFBFBF .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: background1; mso-border-themeshade: 191; background: #E7E6E6; mso-background-themecolor: background2; padding: .75pt 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 19.05pt;\">\n<p style=\"mso-para-margin-top: .2gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0in; mso-para-margin-bottom: .2gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 70%; mso-pagination: none; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-element-left: center; mso-element-top: .05pt; mso-height-rule: exactly; margin: 2.4pt 0in 2.4pt 0in;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.0pt; line-height: 70%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\" lang=\"AR-SA\">درجة الوضوح الإشعاعية</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .5in 10.0pt 0in;\" dir=\"RTL\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\" lang=\"AR-SA\">جدول رقم (2): المواصفات الفنية لجمع البيانات الجيومكانية والمساحية</span></p>",
